OL,5,G1300 Classical Live
OL,6,     FElizabeth Alker introduces
OL,7,     Fhighlights from the Proms
OL,8,     Fincluding music by Schumann. From
OL,9,     FMecklenburg-Vorpommern Festival,
OL,10,     FBenjamin Appl performs Beethoven.
OL,11,G1600 Composer of the Week: Stephen
OL,12,G     Sondheim
OL,13,     F4/5. Donald Macleod reflects back
OL,14,     Fon the life and work of Titan of
OL,15,     FMusical Theatre Stephen Sondheim.
OL,16,G1700 In Tune
OL,17,     FMembers of the Hunan Song and
OL,18,     FDance Theatre perform live in the
OL,19,     Fstudio and dancer Steven McRae and
OL,20,     Fviolinist Vasko Vassilev on their
OL,21,     Fnew Paganini project.
