OL,5,G2330 'Round Midnight
OL,6,     FSeonaid Aitken, sitting in for
OL,7,     FSoweto Kinch, presents another
OL,8,     Fhour of the best in jazz, and Emma
OL,9,     FSmith returns with her fourth
OL,10,     FFlowers choice of the week.
OL,11,G0030 Through the Night
OL,12,     FFrench virtuoso pianist David Fray
OL,13,     Fperforms in Mozart's Piano
OL,14,     FConcerto No 20. Also, we hear the
OL,15,     FIrish premiere of Cindy McTee's
OL,16,     F'Timepiece' and Richard Strauss's
OL,17,     F'Ein Heldenleben'.
